{
  "text": {
    "OT_SS_SANCTUARY_N": "Sanctuary",
    "OT_SS_SANCTUARY_DS": "The settlement stood by one of its own. Spirits are high, though outsiders have taken notice.",
    "OT_SS_ORCHARD_N": "Ancient Orchard",
    "OT_SS_ORCHARD_DS": "A crop nobody alive had ever grown, now thriving in the settlement's fields.",
    "OT_SS_RELICS_N": "Relic Hall",
    "OT_SS_RELICS_DS": "Relics from the ruins on display, drawing curious settlers and the odd trader.",
    "OT_SS_D1_O1": "Let it run free",
    "OT_SS_D1_O2": "Charge a stall fee (units)",
    "OT_SS_D1_T": "The Night Market",
    "OT_SS_D1_Q": "Should the night market pay a fee?",
    "OT_SS_D1_D": "Traders want to run a night market in the plaza once the work shifts end. It would keep the place lively, and the stalls could pay a fee to the Overseer.",
    "OT_SS_D2_O1": "Claim the salvage yourself",
    "OT_SS_D2_O2": "Strip it for parts for the settlement",
    "OT_SS_D2_T": "Salvage Rights",
    "OT_SS_D2_Q": "Who gets the salvage?",
    "OT_SS_D2_D": "Scouts found a cargo pod from a wrecked freighter half buried outside the walls. Its seals still hold.",
    "OT_SS_D3_O1": "Give them a bed (settlers worry)",
    "OT_SS_D3_O2": "Trade medicine for the trinket",
    "OT_SS_D3_T": "A Fevered Traveller",
    "OT_SS_D3_Q": "Give the traveller a bed?",
    "OT_SS_D3_D": "A traveller staggers in with a fever, asking for a bed until it breaks. They have little to offer but a trinket from their pack.",
    "OT_SS_D4_O1": "Download the coordinates",
    "OT_SS_D4_O2": "Wire it into the perimeter sensors",
    "OT_SS_D4_T": "The Buried Beacon",
    "OT_SS_D4_Q": "What should be done with the beacon?",
    "OT_SS_D4_D": "Builders digging a new foundation hit an old survey beacon. It still hums, and its memory is full of coordinates.",
    "OT_SS_D5_O1": "Fund a full festival (adds debt)",
    "OT_SS_D5_O2": "Keep it small",
    "OT_SS_D5_T": "Festival of Lights",
    "OT_SS_D5_Q": "How big should the festival be?",
    "OT_SS_D5_D": "The settlers ask for a festival to mark the end of the building season: lanterns, music, fireworks over the rooftops.",
    "OT_SS_D6_O1": "Side with the crew (adds debt)",
    "OT_SS_D6_O2": "Side with the foreman",
    "OT_SS_D6_T": "The Wage Dispute",
    "OT_SS_D6_Q": "Whose side is the Overseer on?",
    "OT_SS_D6_D": "Two workers stand before the Overseer. One says the foreman has been short-changing the night crew. The foreman says the crew has been short-changing the work.",
    "OT_SS_S1_O1": "Let them stay",
    "OT_SS_S1_O2": "Turn them away",
    "OT_SS_S1_T": "A Stranger at the Gate",
    "OT_SS_S1_Q": "Let the stranger stay?",
    "OT_SS_S1_D": "A stranger in worn armour asks for shelter. They give a name, but nothing else about where they have come from.",
    "OT_SS_S2_O1": "Open it carefully",
    "OT_SS_S2_O2": "Sell it unopened (units)",
    "OT_SS_S2_T": "A Sealed Vault",
    "OT_SS_S2_Q": "Open the vault?",
    "OT_SS_S2_D": "A farmer clearing a cave found a sealed vault of ancient seeds. Collectors would pay well for it unopened.",
    "OT_SS_S3_O1": "Send a search party",
    "OT_SS_S3_O2": "Light a beacon and wait",
    "OT_SS_S3_T": "Overdue",
    "OT_SS_S3_Q": "Send a search party?",
    "OT_SS_S3_D": "A survey team left two days ago to map the ridge. They should have been back yesterday.",
    "OT_SS_H_S1": "The Stranger at the Gate",
    "OT_SS_H_S2": "The Seed Vault",
    "OT_SS_H_S3": "The Lost Survey",
    "OT_SS_S1B_O1": "Keep their secret",
    "OT_SS_S1B_O2": "Hand them over for the bounty",
    "OT_SS_S1B_T": "Rumours",
    "OT_SS_S1B_Q": "Keep the stranger's secret?",
    "OT_SS_S1B_D": "The stranger has worked hard and kept to themselves. Now a passing pilot claims they are a deserter from a mercenary crew, and that the crew pays well for deserters.",
    "OT_SS_S1C_O1": "Stand together",
    "OT_SS_S1C_O2": "Pay the crew to leave (adds debt)",
    "OT_SS_S1C_T": "The Crew Comes Looking",
    "OT_SS_S1C_Q": "How should the settlement answer?",
    "OT_SS_S1C_D": "A dropship lands at the edge of the settlement. The crew wants their deserter back, and they are not asking politely.",
    "OT_SS_S2B_O1": "Plant them for the settlement",
    "OT_SS_S2B_O2": "Keep the best, plant the rest",
    "OT_SS_S2B_T": "The Old Seeds",
    "OT_SS_S2B_Q": "What should become of the seeds?",
    "OT_SS_S2B_D": "Most of the seeds are dust, but a handful are alive: a crop nobody alive has ever grown.",
    "OT_SS_S3B_O1": "Bring them home, with the relics",
    "OT_SS_S3B_O2": "Bring them home, leave the relics",
    "OT_SS_S3B_T": "Shelter in the Ruins",
    "OT_SS_S3B_Q": "Bring the relics home?",
    "OT_SS_S3B_D": "The search party found the survey team sheltering in old ruins after a storm, unhurt. The walls around them are covered in relics nobody recognises.",
    "OT_SS_S3C_O1": "Put them on display",
    "OT_SS_S3C_O2": "Hand them to the Overseer (nanites)",
    "OT_SS_S3C_T": "The Relics",
    "OT_SS_S3C_Q": "What should be done with the relics?",
    "OT_SS_S3C_D": "The relics are back in the settlement, and everyone has an opinion about them."
  },
